Note if we started at the point A then we would not have had a CE! Agent 2 would not have been maximizing! For this economy there is no CE because agents want to go to different loci

 & \emph{Setup.} Recall for agent 2 you want the curve the most to the left possible.

\textbf{What goes wrong:}
Same as before, agent 2 wants to go to a corner becaause that point is feasible and gives him maximum utility agent 1 is  pointing at a different locus. 
